{"id":"n61539-1-7","stage":3,"title":"사연 · 故事","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n61539-1-7-1","ko":"이번 달에 지역 신문사에서 독자들의 사연을 모집한대.","zh":"这个月，当地的报社在征集读者的故事呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"달에","meaning":"月","explanation":"달：月；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"달","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62266","senseId":"2","lemma":"달","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지역","meaning":"地域，地区，区域","explanation":"지역：地域，地区，区域","readings":[{"term":"지역","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71487","senseId":"1","lemma":"지역","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"신문사에서","meaning":"报社","explanation":"신문사：报社；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"신문사","audio":"/audio/03a21393f6e94cd35e6b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65339","senseId":"1","lemma":"신문사","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"독자들의","meaning":"读者","explanation":"독자：读者；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象。；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"독자","audio":"/audio/778e2b120bfc4d586184.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48501","senseId":"1","lemma":"독자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"사연을","meaning":"故事，书信内容","explanation":"사연：故事，书信内容；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"사연","audio":"/audio/3d876124ad9a51a19744.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61539","senseId":"1","lemma":"사연","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"모집한대.","meaning":"招募，征集，招聘","explanation":"모집하다：招募，征集，招聘；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"모집하다","audio":"/audio/d8ede750554c0a4ecf3a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16146","senseId":"1","lemma":"모집하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"2f941e6eb2150679","term":"달","zh":"月","audio":"/audio/2f941e6eb2150679c43f.mp3","entryId":"62266","definition":"把一年分为十二个的每个时间段。","pronunciation":["달"]},{"id":"770eb9e292c17199","term":"지역","zh":"地域，地区，区域","audio":"/audio/770eb9e292c171999d24.mp3","entryId":"71487","definition":"根据某个特征或一定的标准划分其范围的地方。","pronunciation":["지역"]},{"id":"03a21393f6e94cd3","term":"신문사","zh":"报社","audio":"/audio/03a21393f6e94cd35e6b.mp3","entryId":"65339","definition":"制造并发行报纸的公司。","pronunciation":["신문사"]},{"id":"778e2b120bfc4d58","term":"독자","zh":"读者","audio":"/audio/778e2b120bfc4d586184.mp3","entryId":"48501","definition":"阅读书、报纸或杂志等的人。","pronunciation":["독짜"]},{"id":"3d876124ad9a51a1","term":"사연","zh":"故事，书信内容","audio":"/audio/3d876124ad9a51a19744.mp3","entryId":"61539","definition":"信件或话的内容。","pronunciation":["사연"]},{"id":"d8ede750554c0a4e","term":"모집하다","zh":"招募，征集，招聘","audio":"/audio/d8ede750554c0a4ecf3a.mp3","entryId":"16146","definition":"在大范围内公开选拔或募集符合特定条件的人、作品或东西等。","pronunciation":["모지파다"]}],"audio":"/audio/8f07fb04899dc7857dfe.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n61539-1-7-2","ko":"정말? 나도 한번 보내 볼까?","zh":"真的吗？我也试着寄一份看看吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"나도","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"한번","meaning":"一下","explanation":"한번：一下","readings":[{"term":"한번","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57336","senseId":"2","lemma":"한번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"보내","meaning":"送，寄","explanation":"보내다：送，寄；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"보내다","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66375","senseId":"1","lemma":"보내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"볼까?","meaning":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","explanation":"보다：试着做（-아/어 보다）；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62171","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"54e30ff4210956a6","term":"한번","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/54e30ff4210956a6d721.mp3","entryId":"57336","definition":"表示把某事当做试验来尝试。","pronunciation":["한번"]},{"id":"8af300ffd85ed5a1","term":"보내다","zh":"送，寄","audio":"/audio/8af300ffd85ed5a13777.mp3","entryId":"66375","definition":"把人或东西等弄到别的地方去。","pronunciation":["보내다"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"62171","definition":"试着做（-아/어 보다）","pronunciation":["보다"]}],"audio":"/audio/78092d341d3004f0b29a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.206,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=61539","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":117,"sequenceScore":3.0327,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["这个月，当地的报社在征集读者的故事呢。","真的吗？我也试着寄一份看看吧？","爸爸，您生日时我为您做点什么好？"],"answer":0},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这个月，当地的报社在征集读者的故事呢。","真的吗？我也试着寄一份看看吧？","爸爸，您生日时我为您做点什么好？"],"answer":1}]}
